- content_for :title, "Start Free ... OurGruuv"

%section.marketing-hero
  .container
    %p.marketing-kicker Start Free
    %h1.mb-3 Upload a job description. See clarity take shape.
    %p.lead.mb-4
      Free forever. Paste or upload a JD ... we’ll outline assignments, abilities, and values, flag what might be missing, and preview how growth can look. When you create an organization, those results can become real objects in OurGruuv.
    %p.small.text-muted.mb-0
      Wizard implementation coming next ... below is the outline of the flow.

%section.marketing-section.marketing-section-alt
  .container
    %h2.h3.mb-4 Wizard outline (stub)

    .marketing-wizard-step
      %p.marketing-kicker Step 1
      %h3.h5.mb-2 Source the job description
      %ul.mb-0
        %li Upload a file (PDF / DOC / DOCX / text)
        %li Or paste into a textarea
        %li Primary user: People Team partner (also works for a sample role)

    .marketing-wizard-step
      %p.marketing-kicker Step 2
      %h3.h5.mb-2 LLM turn
      %ul.mb-0
        %li Parse JD → proposed assignments, abilities, values
        %li Feedback on what may be missing or underspecified
        %li Progress / wait state while the consultation runs

    .marketing-wizard-step
      %p.marketing-kicker Step 3
      %h3.h5.mb-2 Growth-style preview
      %ul.mb-0
        %li Show assignments, abilities, and values from the JD
        %li Include demo / fake progress data illustrating continuous growth and coaching
        %li Soft CTAs: create organization (promote to discrete OG objects) · Solutions · Pricing

    .marketing-wizard-step
      %p.marketing-kicker Later
      %h3.h5.mb-2 After org creation
      %ul.mb-0
        %li Promote wizard output into real MAAP objects
        %li Value Billing meter starts with org usage ... wizard itself stays free

    .alert.alert-light.border.mt-4.mb-0
      %strong Not implemented yet.
      This page is the product outline only. Full upload, LLM invocation, and preview UI will be built in a follow-up.

    .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2.mt-4
      = link_to "Back to Home", root_path, class: "btn btn-outline-dark"
      = link_to "See Solutions", solutions_path, class: "btn btn-dark"
